    INDUSTRIAL: "A style inspired by warehouses and factories: exposed brick, metal, concrete and bare bulbs.",
    JAPANDI: "A blend of Japanese and Scandinavian design: calm, natural materials, clean lines and little clutter.",
    LAMP: "Designers layer light: ceiling lights for the room, lamps for warmth and reading.",
