    STREAM: "A small, babbling brook running through a meadow or woodland.",
    SUNHAT: "A wide-brimmed straw hat for gardening and picnics on long sunny days.",
    TEAPOT: "A pot of tea, poured into mismatched vintage cups.",
    THATCH: "A roof made of straw or reeds, a hallmark of old English country cottages.",
